        <head>WARRINGTON.</head>
        <p>WARRINGTON.</p>
        <p>Personal.</p>
        <p>"The Mersey Brigade is,"eays a Liverpool clntern- porary,'Tortunate in the appointment of Major F M Room., the adjutant of the Ist V B South Lanca- shire, as Brigade Major. He will take up his duties for this year's camp fresh from the training of his own corps with the special brigade. It will be probable, therefore, that the Mersey Brigade will directly benefit from the experiences of the Liver- pool Army Corps Volunteer brigaie training."</p>
        <p>THE GLEN-SPEY DISTILLERY, Situated in the finest Whisky-producing District of Scotland, is the property of W. &amp;A, Gilbey. This Whisky is made entirely from home-grown Barley and is kept absolutely unblended in His Majesty's Bonded Warehouses to mature, and sold by W. a A. Gilbey's agents in every town at 35. 6d. per bottle. Sunday School Treat at Appleton Thorn The annual children's Sunday School treat at this village which took place last Friday was favoured with charming weather. First there was a short evensong in church, at three o'clock. An excellent tea followed in the schoolroom, after Ithicb the children had sports and games in an adjoining field, At seven o'clock books were given tho•ze who had attended most regularly, and had behaved best. Subsequently Miss Holt, who is vacating the headmistress'-ship of the National Schools, after nine years' excellent service, was the recipient of a handsome silver teapot and cream jug. The Vicar, in presenting her with these gifts. subscribed for by her numerous well-wishers in the parish, referred to her unwearied efforts on behalf of the moral and intellectual interest of the children entrusted to her care. and to the loss the parish would sustain in her departure. Mr Barber, treasurer of the schools, concurred in what the Vicar had said. Miss Holt suitably replied. The teapot bore the following inscription :—"Presented to Miss Holt on her marriage, by friends and scholars at Appleton Thorn, July sth, 1901." A framed illuminated list of the subscribers will be given to her.</p>
